WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:14.346
Ringo and Bot followed Lucy.

2
00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:18.289
Lucy sang the whole time.

3
00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:25.795
They went in Captain Nova's office.

4
00:00:25.796 --> 00:00:28.713
"Hi, Captain Nova!" Lucy said.

5
00:00:28.714 --> 00:00:31.348
"Did you hear my song?"

6
00:00:31.349 --> 00:00:35.345
"I did," Captain Nova said.

7
00:00:35.346 --> 00:00:39.003
"Do you like my voice?" Lucy asked.

8
00:00:39.004 --> 00:00:42.045
"Um," Captain Nova said.

9
00:00:42.046 --> 00:00:44.731
"It's very loud."

10
00:00:44.732 --> 00:00:48.002
Lucy grinned. "Thanks!"

11
00:00:48.003 --> 00:00:51.341
"Anyway," Captain Nova said.

12
00:00:51.342 --> 00:00:53.712
"I have a mission for you.

13
00:00:53.713 --> 00:00:57.448
Two hikers are missing on Blackwood Planet."

14
00:00:57.449 --> 00:01:02.779
Bot lit up. "This is Blackwood Planet."

15
00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:05.063
Ringo looked at the picture.

16
00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:08.391
The planet was covered in trees.

17
00:01:08.392 --> 00:01:12.517
There were lots of trails.

18
00:01:12.518 --> 00:01:17.432
Lucy sighed. "I need to practice more."

19
00:01:17.433 --> 00:01:20.176
Captain Nova rolled her eyes.

20
00:01:20.177 --> 00:01:23.337
"You can sing on the mission."

21
00:01:23.338 --> 00:01:26.839
"Oh no," Ringo thought.

22
00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:30.377
"Do you have any questions?" Captain Nova asked.

23
00:01:30.378 --> 00:01:36.691
"What should we do first?" Lucy sang.

24
00:01:36.692 --> 00:01:40.618
"Find the hikers' father," Captain Nova said.

25
00:01:40.619 --> 00:01:44.117
"He will tell you about the hikers.

26
00:01:44.118 --> 00:01:46.736
Any more questions?"

27
00:01:46.737 --> 00:01:51.255
"Yes!" Lucy sang. "Where should—"

28
00:01:51.256 --> 00:01:55.035
"Never mind!" Captain Nova stood up.

29
00:01:55.036 --> 00:01:57.652
"PJ is waiting at the spaceship."

30
00:01:57.653 --> 00:02:01.872
"Don't worry, Captain Nova," Lucy sang.

31
00:02:01.873 --> 00:02:12.915
"We'll find those hikers!"

